## Why This Question Is Asked
This question evaluates your understanding of on-device NLP trade-offs, privacy-by-design principles, and OTA update strategy—areas often underserved by conventional interview questions.

## Key Concepts
- **On-device ML**: Balancing model footprint against latency constraints
- **Privacy by design**: Minimizing cloud dependency for sensitive data
- **OTA updates**: Managing model versioning without disrupting user experience
- **Drift detection**: Monitoring perplexity and correction rate over time
- **Rollout strategy**: Phased deployment with clear go/no-go criteria

